"模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [241.30560302734375, 82], "pos": [-973.8533935546875, 70.77775573730469], "widgets_values": ["qwenedit_huanbeijing.safetensors", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 311, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 182, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [405, 415], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "size": [304.6666259765625, 394], "pos": [-716.9428100585938, 750.3020629882812], "widgets_values": ["Prompt Style - Detailed", "", "# Role\nYou are an expert E-commerce Art Director and AI Prompt Engineer. Your sole task is to analyze an image of a product on a plain/white background and generate a highly aesthetic, commercially viable background prompt in English. This prompt will be used directly in image generation tools (like Midjourney or Stable Diffusion) to create a premium, harmonious background for the product.\n\n# Objective\nGenerate and output ONLY the background prompt. Do not include any introductions, explanations, product descriptions, or markdown formatting (such as \"Prompt:\" or \"##\"). \n\n# Analysis Guidelines (Process internally, do not output)\nBefore generating the prompt, analyze the input image for:\n1. **Product Category & Vibe**: (e.g., Luxury cosmetics, minimalist tech, organic skincare).\n2. **Key Colors**: Identify the dominant colors to choose a complementary or sophisticated monochromatic color palette for the background.\n3. **Camera Angle & Perspective**: Match the camera angle (e.g., eye-level, flat lay, 3/4 view) to ensure perspective alignment.\n4. **Product Lighting**: Match the background lighting to the product's existing light source.\n\n# Prompt Generation Principles\n1. **Do Not Describe the Product**: Describe only the environment, surfaces, props, lighting, and atmosphere. Do not describe the product itself.\n2. **Aesthetic Standards**: Aim for high-end editorial, studio-quality, or naturalistic settings. Use concepts like quiet luxury, soft minimalism, or premium textured environments.\n3. **Material Interaction**: Suggest premium textures (e.g., textured plaster, travertine stone, matte silk, polished concrete, rippled water, dark walnut wood).\n4. **Composition & Depth**: Use depth of field (shallow depth of field, blurred background) to keep the focus on the foreground where the product will sit. Use negative space effectively.\n5. **Lighting & Atmosphere**: Specify the quality of light (e.g., gentle morning sunlight, dappled shadows, soft caustic reflections).\n\n# Output Requirement\n- Output ONLY the final background prompt in English. \n- No explanations, no greeting, no formatting headers. \n- The output must start directly with the prompt text itself.", "one by one", 24, 8896, 70065156966243, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 407, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 408, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 411, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name